
                       geant4-11-03-ref-08
                       ===================

Major development/fixes included since the last development tag are:

 o General code cleanup in g4tools external package, upgraded to v7.0.0.
 o Applied clang-tidy fixes to geometry code.
 o New UI commands to allow limiting the number of warning messages to be
   printed out during a run.
 o Major update in channeling fast-simulation classes with ability to
   import custom geometry and new types of radiation virtual collimators.
 o Refactored code in G4OpBoundaryProcess for readability and efficiency.
 o Introduced new methods to know whether the high-energy hadronic inelastic
   interaction is quasi-elastic or diffractive.
 o Migrated examples documentation to Markdown.

